notification.wav, alert.wav and ringtone.mp3: webOS's default notification, alert and
ringtone sounds, from LunaCE's sounds/ (https://github.com/webOSArchive/LunaCE/tree/master/sounds),
Apache License 2.0. Each is byte-identical to the file of the same name in /usr/palm/sounds on
the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0), checked by MD5 on 2026-09-22. LunaSysMgr plays the
first two as its "sysmgr_notification" and "sysmgr_alert" feedback samples, which are
preloaded copies of them.

battery_full.mp3: webOS's "battery charged" sound, from the same LunaCE sounds/ folder,
Apache License 2.0; byte-identical to /usr/palm/sounds/battery_full.mp3 on the reference
TouchPad, checked by MD5 on 2026-09-22.

feedback/appclose.wav, birdappclose.wav, carddrag.wav, LauncherOpenApp.wav and
LauncherCloseApp.wav: LunaSysMgr's feedback sounds, copied on 2026-09-22 from
/usr/share/systemsounds/*.pcm on the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0). They are HP webOS
system sounds and are not in LunaCE's repository. The only change is a WAV header on
the raw samples, whose format PulseAudio on the device reports as s16le, 1 channel, 44100 Hz
(`pactl list samples`). Shipped as abandonware, like the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad
wallpapers.
